    <MetaInfo>
      <NameIsFileName value="True" />
      <Name>SettlementReconciliation</Name>
      <Description>Physical-gas pipeline delivery reconciliation. Joins Tier-1 book, pipeline-allocation, counterparty, and Gas Daily index on (gas_day, contract, point); decomposes any volume break into an uncaptured scheduling cut vs an allocation variance; tests for a path imbalance; and restates the cash impact at Gas Daily + basis. Implements Appendix A of the Energy Settlements Delivery Workflow.</Description>
